// peddlerLawPrice: law.price_market for one unit — the base price of the definition × the scarcity of its part class in
// the hub now (crafting economy) × the risk of its legality in the dome, × the peddler's appraisal of the grade and the
// wear (a dead thing keeps 30 %). At least one minor unit.
func (r *Runtime) peddlerLawPrice(i inv.Item, stock map[string]int64) int64 {
